aces deletion is silent.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected in this batch. Agent is systematically preparing to make targeted edits to the plan based on review findings. Agent has identified 5 specific edits needed and is gathering exact text locations for surgical modifications.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent is successfully making targeted edits to the plan based on review findings. First edit (Phase 1, Step 1.5 - Next.js workspace root warning) completed successfully.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent is proceeding with second targeted edit to Phase 6, Step 6.2 to correct schema diff attribution.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent successfully completed second edit (Phase 6, Step 6.2 - schema diff attribution correction) and is proceeding with third edit.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent successfully completed third edit (Phase 6, Step 6.7 - release dry-run expected failure note).\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent successfully completed fourth edit (Summary of Changes table - schema diff description) and fifth edit (Phase 8, Step 8.1 - commit message schema diff note). Agent is proceeding with sixth and final edit.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent successfully completed sixth and final edit (Phase 3, Step 3.2 - logging note for transformPackageJson). All targeted plan updates completed.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent successfully completed seventh edit (Section g - schema generation output note) and is reviewing Section b (Information Available) to ensure consistency of schema diff description across all plan sections.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent successfully completed eighth edit (Section b - Information Available summary) to ensure consistency of trial run findings across all plan sections.\n\n\n---\n\nNo actionable issues detected. Agent has completed all eight targeted plan edits and is now proceeding to write the final d